      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "虫穴って場所に、ワラジムシが出やがるんだ。\n一匹二匹なら怖くねえが群れで湧いてきやがって……\n討伐隊を組みたいんだが、もう志願者が居ねえ……\n誰でもいい、駆除してくれると大助かりだ！",
        "official_en": "Bugs' Burrow is full of blight lice. One of them isn't\nscary, but it's a bad time once they start to swarm.\nI'd like to send an extermination team. But I'm all\nout of volunteers. I'd take help from anyone.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
