      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "あそこは昔、ワラジムシの狩り場だったんだが\n返り討ちに遭った奴をエサに、凶暴な奴が育って……\n人間様が狩られる側になっちまったのさ。\n礼はさせてもらうぜ。とっといてくれ！",
        "official_en": "Folks used to go there looking to hunt blight lice.\nBut the lice fought back. They got a taste for\nhuman flesh and... Well, we don't have to worry\nabout that now. Here, take this as my thanks!",
        "real_en": null
      },
